    <h1>Rent a stump grinder, or hire it out?</h1>
    <p class="lede">People ask us this one straight up, and it deserves a straight answer. So here's the real math on renting a grinder around Spokane: which yards actually have one, what the day costs once you add the truck, the trailer, the waiver, and the teeth, what a rental machine can and can't chew through, and an honest take on when renting wins.</p>
